{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Stein流形"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"alias":[{"Plain":"Stein 空间"},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Stein 流形”"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n\n<p>复 $n$ 维空间的复子流形称为 Stein 流形. 它是代数几何中仿射概形的类比.</p>\n"}}